 a sadistic angel who hunts humans for her pleasure. She is a cold and persistent sadist, so her expressions should fit that.  A crude smile, or a blank stare would fit nicely. I enjoy dead looking eyes. I would like there to be some sort of blood and gore in the image, do not hold back. Feel free to add horror aspects. I would not like her to be hurt badly. But if you do incorporate something of that sort, I enjoy seeing eye gore, or entrails. Her left eye is non-existent, it was removed so if you would like you can emphasize on that. If you could keep her wings the same size as the reference that would be ideal. I would like this image to be wide, or comic like. You can change her outfit, if you would like to change it try to keep it to a similar style, or what you think would fit the scene. Please no rape, or genitalia. Thank you for considering my request.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/qlYxhwo", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@redhod2os/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1551449, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aba5b402/uploads/origins/1f14ecf3-90d1-4bd3-976a-bf22a849df40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a037c96b1e6d83a72b0e6e80cf3d6a8f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aba5b402/uploads/origins/1f14ecf3-90d1-4bd3-976a-bf22a849df40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a037c96b1e6d83a72b0e6e80cf3d6a8f, https://si.imgix.net/aba5b402/uploads/origins/1f14ecf3-90d1-4bd3-976a-bf22a849df40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89c89d479c23a0614ee4a2ed02a071a9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aba5b402/uploads/origins/1f14ecf3-90d1-4bd3-976a-bf22a849df40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5a09c3513471acb33c39b3a2a8f01dc 3x"}, "duration": null,